Utility permits shall be obtained from the director of planning and development upon application made on forms prescribed by the department of planning and development. The written application shall include the following:

- (1) The name and address of the utility; (2) The nature, extent, and location of any work proposed to be done, along with satisfactory plans as attachments showing in detail the location of the proposed facility or operations

